  {
    "type": 19,
    "content": "It feels a bit weird to share it, but we tried to do a recreation of the guide instead of *just* a copy: https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/e/2PACX-1vQHKsA7L-VGS5_JCJeLPUiFJ8mvooLaVRUpkq5t3aeu-rkEPgjZJhjX39t5spXU5jjfixN4SwjXjo08/pubhtml\nHaven't touched it in a while, and we didn't update every tab, but we did add info where it was missing or felt incomplete. In some cases rearranging things.\nStuff like updating the Imports section in Gaming, more links, Doot for Divinity, putting down that Arctic doesn't actually count for Goharut, adding relevant Alchemy bubbles, updating the Gems tab, etc.\n\nWhat we didn't update (ASFAIK): We barely touched Pets (I added Trasher mention to Spice Claiming), didn't touch Construction, didn't touch Tower Defense, Sailing pretty much just has more links, and the Calc just got a wiki link + Untradeable in the Recycle Amount box. I think we might've stopped midway through updating Obols.\n\nWe based it off of open tabs of the original guidesheet, so we started from a more current version. Meaning that it has Gnakor credited, more recently updated Weekly Gem Gain, Frosty Firefight - Wave 140, etc.\n\nWayback Machine version: https://web.archive.org/web/20230403011952/https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/e/2PACX-1vSnlrC_6oW7P89Os4uECnEB_XOVr6TlPa-QhTC62DrtLnRkzQi1UAMnrEZassEaAQb6Cr3TEZAiSVvz/pubhtml#\nScreenshots of original (though they excluded the credits, you can still compare them): https://imgur.com/a/D813iee",
